   "text": "UBI Business School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUBI Business School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUBI Business School, established in 1992 in Brussels, is a leading English-language business school offering top-quality British business programmes with an enterprising focus on Business & Tech, Global Mindset, and Good Citizenship.\nWe exist as an open institution to empower global talents and bridge distances through accessible, innovative, and person-centred education focused on creating value in a responsible manner.\nSince 2012, UBI has been developing its programmes in partnership with Middlesex University London (UK), which ranks as one of the top 500 universities (Higher Education Statistics Agency) and top 10 transnational universities (Times Higher Education) in the world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n30/04/2026 08:09\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n10/04/2026 07:13\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nBelgium\nYearly Fees\nMax: €28,500.00\nMin: €11,900.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n87%\n435 of 500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nBrussels, Luxembourg, Madrid\nCountry\nBelgium\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n24/04/2026\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.wiltz.lu/fr/guichet-citoyen/enseignement/logements-pour-etudiants;\nhttps://www.spotahome.com/fr\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://ubi.edu/scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@ubibusinessschool\nInternship Details\nhttps://my.ubi.edu/course/view.php?id=467\nAdditional Information\n-",
